From: X-WRT <dev@x-wrt.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: PCI: mediatek: add AN7563 compatible

AN7563 uses the MediaTek Gen2 PCIe controller programming model with
additional SoC-specific root-complex and coherency setup.  Add a dedicated
compatible so the driver can select that setup without changing MT7622.

Signed-off-by: X-WRT <dev@x-wrt.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/mediatek-pcie.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/mediatek-pcie.txt
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/mediatek-pcie.txt
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@ MediaTek Gen2 PCIe controller
 
 Required properties:
 - compatible: Should contain one of the following strings:
+	"airoha,an7563-pcie"
 	"mediatek,mt2701-pcie"
 	"mediatek,mt2712-pcie"
 	"mediatek,mt7622-pcie"
